@startuml
skinparam lifelineStrategy solid
autonumber
title Diagrama Devoluciones 6: POST /api/v1/refunds/:id/levels/current/approve (Aprobar el nivel activo)

actor "Aprobador del nivel" as Approver
participant "App Web" as Web
participant "Gateway Controller" as Gateway
participant "Refund Workflow Service" as Service
participant "Role Directory Client\n(servicio externo)" as RoleDir
participant "Transaction Manager\n(QueryRunner)" as TX
participant "refund_orders DB" as OrdersDB
participant "refund_workflow_instances DB" as InstanceDB
participant "refund_workflow_instance_levels DB" as LevelsDB
participant "refund_workflow_actions DB" as ActionsDB

Approver -> Web: Tap en "Aprobar" + comentario opcional
Web -> Gateway: POST /api/v1/refunds/2001/levels/current/approve\n(ApproveLevelDto: { comment })
Gateway -> Service: approveCurrentLevel(refundOrderId: 2001, payload, actor)

Service -> OrdersDB: 1. findRefundOrderWithInstance(2001)
OrdersDB --> Service: order { status: 'OPEN', total: 800.00,\ncurrent_workflow_instance_id: 90 }

Service -> LevelsDB: 2. findInstanceLevels(90)
LevelsDB --> Service: levels[] (level_order, role_code, min_amount,\nmax_amount, approval_policy, required_approvals, status)

Service -> RoleDir: 3. resolveApproversByRole(currentLevel.role_code)
note right of RoleDir
  El rol se resuelve contra el directorio
  externo. La tabla solo guarda role_code:
  nunca la lista de personas.
end note
RoleDir --> Service: employees[]

Service -> Service: 4. assertCanApprove(order, currentLevel, actor, employees)


Service -> ActionsDB: 5. countLevelApprovals(instanceId: 90, levelId: 201)
note right of ActionsDB
  Cuenta las acciones APPROVE ya
  registradas en ESTE nivel y ESTE intento.
  409 si el actor ya firmó (una firma por
  persona y por nivel).
end note
ActionsDB --> Service: approvalsReceived: 0

Service -> Service: 6. evaluateApprovalPolicy(currentLevel, approvalsReceived + 1)
note right of Service
  ANY    -> el nivel queda aprobado con 1 firma
  ALL    -> hace falta la firma de todos los
            empleados del rol
  QUORUM -> hace falta required_approvals
  Si no se alcanza, el nivel sigue
  IN_PROGRESS y solo se registra la firma.
end note

Service -> TX: 7. startTransaction()
activate TX

Service -> ActionsDB: 8. insertWorkflowAction(90, 201, 'APPROVE')
note right of ActionsDB
  - actor_employee_code, actor_role_code
  - comment del revisor
  - system_summary autogenerado
  - previous_status / new_status de la instancia
end note
ActionsDB --> Service: ok

alt La política del nivel quedó satisfecha
    Service -> LevelsDB: 9. closeLevel(201, 'APPROVED', finishedAt: NOW())
    LevelsDB --> Service: ok

    Service -> Service: 10. resolveNextLevel(levels, order.total)


    alt El monto excede el techo del nivel (queda escalera por delante)
        Service -> LevelsDB: 11. openLevel(nextLevelId, 'IN_PROGRESS', startedAt: NOW())
        LevelsDB --> Service: ok

        Service -> InstanceDB: 12. updateCurrentLevelOrder(90, nextLevelOrder)
        note right of InstanceDB
          La instancia sigue IN_APPROVAL:
          solo cambia el nivel activo.
        end note
        InstanceDB --> Service: ok

        Service -> ActionsDB: 13. insertWorkflowAction(90, nextLevelId, 'AUTO_ROUTED')
        note right of ActionsDB
          Deja rastro del ruteo automático
          hacia el siguiente escritorio.
        end note
        ActionsDB --> Service: ok
    else El monto entra en la banda de este nivel (se liquida acá)
        Service -> LevelsDB: 14. markSkippedLevels(higherLevelIds)
        note right of LevelsDB
          Los niveles superiores quedan 'SKIPPED'
          con finished_at = NOW(): el monto nunca
          los alcanzó.
        end note
        LevelsDB --> Service: ok

        Service -> InstanceDB: 15. closeInstance(90, 'APPROVED', currentLevelOrder: NULL, finishedAt: NOW())
        InstanceDB --> Service: ok

        Service -> OrdersDB: 16. closeRefundOrder(2001, 'APPROVED')
     
        OrdersDB --> Service: ok

        Service -> ActionsDB: 17. insertWorkflowAction(90, NULL, 'CLOSED')
        ActionsDB --> Service: ok
    end
end

Service -> TX: 18. commitTransaction()
deactivate TX

Service --> Gateway: 200 OK (ApproveLevelResult:\n{ orderStatus, instanceStatus, currentLevelOrder, approvalsReceived })
Gateway --> Web: 200 OK
Web --> Approver: Aprobación registrada • Nota aprobada o enviada al nivel siguiente
@enduml
